OL,3,GNEWSABird observatory flies high with
OL,4,Awildlife award
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlderney Bird Observatory has landed a
OL,7,Fconservation prize after helping the
OL,8,Fisland win three awards at the Floral
OL,9,FGuernsey Foundation Community Awards.
OL,11,FJudges visited the observatory's base
OL,12,Fat the Hut at Saye in June, where they
OL,13,Fmet volunteers and learned about
OL,14,Fongoing bird recording work.
OL,16,FThe group went on to win the
OL,17,FConservation and Wildlife Award, the
OL,18,Ffourth time an Alderney organisation
OL,19,Fhas claimed the honour.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
